# Spiel-Uhr (electronic music box): Sentimental Journey - Haenschen klein - Du, Du liegst mir am Herzen
# Busch Microtronic manual Part 2, p. 54-55. Needs the tone circuit (multivibrator) on outputs 1-4.
# Plays the three melodies one after another and repeats until Reset.

